WEBVTT

00:00:00.378 --> 00:00:32.982
Under the Moon by Rowena Akanyemi Chapter 1 AOL 500km over Europe Ship OM 45 move north In a room at the back of the ship Keir watched the numbers on the computer in front of him.

00:00:33.042 --> 00:00:35.944
Time for dinner?

00:00:36.004 --> 00:00:38.166
Rilla said.

00:00:38.226 --> 00:00:45.850
The numbers changed quickly and Keir's eyes didn't move.

00:00:45.910 --> 00:00:51.404
Rilla went across the room to his table.

00:00:51.464 --> 00:00:56.067
She began to watch the numbers too.

00:00:56.127 --> 00:00:59.620
What's wrong with a satellite?"

00:00:59.680 --> 00:01:01.660
she asked.

00:01:01.720 --> 00:01:11.607
She was a beautiful girl, about twenty years old, with long black hair and big eyes.

00:01:11.666 --> 00:01:14.978
Nothing's wrong with a satellite.

00:01:15.038 --> 00:01:17.910
Keir answered quietly.

00:01:17.970 --> 00:01:20.892
It's the AOL.

00:01:20.952 --> 00:01:26.910
He began to write the numbers in the book on his table.

00:01:26.970 --> 00:01:32.198
Suddenly, the numbers stopped changing.

00:01:32.258 --> 00:01:35.898
Tia looked at Rila.

00:01:35.958 --> 00:01:39.420
Over Europe, he said.

00:01:39.480 --> 00:01:41.511
It's happening.

00:01:41.571 --> 00:01:45.092
The AOL is breaking up.

00:01:45.152 --> 00:01:51.104
There are big holes in the AOL and they're getting bigger.

00:01:51.164 --> 00:01:53.722
You're right!

00:01:53.782 --> 00:01:59.502
Shall we see Captain Seru now, before dinner?"

00:01:59.562 --> 00:02:02.294
Kia stood up.

00:02:02.354 --> 00:02:08.496
He was nearly two metres tall, with dark eyes and hair.

00:02:08.556 --> 00:02:13.280
Yes, come on, he said.

00:02:13.340 --> 00:02:18.482
Quickly, they went to Captain Seru's room.

00:02:18.541 --> 00:02:22.627
They waited at the door.

00:02:22.686 --> 00:02:26.722
Captain Seru called.

00:02:26.782 --> 00:02:30.916
She was a little woman with a fat face.

00:02:30.975 --> 00:02:32.578
Come in!

00:02:32.638 --> 00:02:35.160
Would you like a drink?

00:02:35.220 --> 00:02:37.582
No, thank you.

00:02:37.641 --> 00:02:39.834
Keir answered.

00:02:39.894 --> 00:02:43.708
I'd like you to look at these numbers.

00:02:43.768 --> 00:02:48.226
Keir gave Captain Seru his book.

00:02:48.285 --> 00:02:52.711
Captain Seru looked at the numbers.

00:02:52.771 --> 00:02:57.142
Suddenly her face changed.

00:02:57.202 --> 00:03:00.853
No, no, she said.

00:03:00.913 --> 00:03:02.974
I don't want to talk.

00:03:03.034 --> 00:03:05.664
It's late and I'm tired.

00:03:05.724 --> 00:03:09.196
Sit down and have a drink.

00:03:09.255 --> 00:03:13.567
Kia and Rila sat down.

00:03:13.627 --> 00:03:18.679
There was a big window in Captain Seru's room.

00:03:18.739 --> 00:03:24.384
Keir looked out of the window at the dark sky.

00:03:24.444 --> 00:03:27.186
He saw the moon.

00:03:27.246 --> 00:03:32.469
It was cold and white in the dark sky.

00:03:32.529 --> 00:03:36.962
Captain Seru, he began.

00:03:37.022 --> 00:03:39.304
It's important.

00:03:39.364 --> 00:03:42.657
Look at those numbers carefully.

00:03:42.716 --> 00:03:47.564
The AOL is beginning to stop.

00:03:47.624 --> 00:03:53.862
Captain Siru stood up and put her hands in her pockets.

00:03:53.921 --> 00:03:59.334
She went to the window and looked at the sky.

00:03:59.394 --> 00:04:07.356
Three hundred years ago, Earth nearly died, Rilla said.

00:04:07.416 --> 00:04:23.495
Earth stopped dying because of the AOL, but now, over Europe, the AOL is breaking up We would like you to talk to Earth Commander.

00:04:23.555 --> 00:04:27.986
Captain Seru did not move.

00:04:28.046 --> 00:04:30.976
Do you remember a die?

00:04:31.036 --> 00:04:32.847
She asked.

00:04:32.907 --> 00:04:36.288
She didn't wait for an answer.

00:04:36.347 --> 00:04:41.249
I was on his ship two years ago.

00:04:41.308 --> 00:04:49.230
One evening, the satellite gave us interesting numbers about the AOL.

00:04:49.290 --> 00:04:54.762
We went back to earth and saw earth commander.

00:04:54.822 --> 00:04:58.714
Captain Saru stopped speaking.

00:04:58.774 --> 00:05:02.105
Rila looked at Kia.

00:05:02.165 --> 00:05:07.288
And then, she asked Captain Saru.

00:05:07.347 --> 00:05:12.480
Gog was angry, very angry.

00:05:12.540 --> 00:05:15.112
Captain Saru said.

00:05:15.172 --> 00:05:28.164
In the end, he sent Adai to the moon Adai's there now, commander of the moon colony under the moon.

00:05:28.224 --> 00:05:32.936
Kia waited for a second or two.

00:05:32.996 --> 00:05:40.590
I know about Adai, but we need to talk to earth commander again.

00:05:40.650 --> 00:05:44.202
These numbers are worse.

00:05:44.262 --> 00:05:48.370
Captain Seru's face went red.

00:05:48.430 --> 00:05:51.458
You don't understand.

00:05:51.518 --> 00:05:54.678
I'm not going to talk to Gog.

00:05:54.738 --> 00:06:01.230
Last time, he sent me to our weathership in the Antarctic.

00:06:01.290 --> 00:06:06.510
This is my first ship for two years.

00:06:06.570 --> 00:06:11.482
And Captain Seru began drinking.

00:06:11.542 --> 00:06:14.713
Kia stood up.

00:06:14.772 --> 00:06:18.214
Thank you, Captain Seru.

00:06:18.274 --> 00:06:22.297
Captain Saru said nothing.

00:06:22.356 --> 00:06:30.321
Kia and Rila left the room and walked slowly downstairs.

00:06:30.380 --> 00:06:34.432
The ship was dark and quiet.

00:06:34.492 --> 00:06:41.046
It was eight o'clock and everybody was at dinner.

00:06:41.105 --> 00:06:45.138
What are we going to do next?

00:06:45.198 --> 00:06:47.510
Rila asked.

00:06:47.570 --> 00:06:52.814
I need to talk to a die," Kia said.

00:06:52.874 --> 00:06:56.737
Okay, talk to a die.

00:06:56.797 --> 00:07:02.500
But he's far away on the moon colony, Rilla said.

00:07:02.560 --> 00:07:06.872
Let's visit Commander Zadak.

00:07:06.932 --> 00:07:11.616
Zadak, Commander of Australia.

00:07:11.676 --> 00:07:13.886
He's famous.

00:07:13.946 --> 00:07:18.438
Yes, he's my father's friend.

00:07:18.498 --> 00:07:23.278
He worked with my father in Brazil 10 years ago.

00:07:23.338 --> 00:07:26.930
Perhaps he can help us.

00:07:26.990 --> 00:07:30.142
Kia smiled.

00:07:30.202 --> 00:07:32.112
Good.

00:07:32.172 --> 00:07:35.624
We return to Earth next week.

00:07:35.684 --> 00:07:42.296
I can phone a die from Kisangani and then we can go to Australia.

00:07:42.356 --> 00:07:45.768
But now I'm hungry.

00:07:45.828 --> 00:07:57.206
Let's get some dinner.

00:07:57.266 --> 00:08:30.014
Chapter 2 Visit to Australia On Friday, after 3 weeks in space, Keir and Rilla finished work and left ship OM45 on a space plane to Kisangani.

00:08:30.074 --> 00:08:38.721
Keir phoned a die and Rilla phoned Commander Zadak in Australia.

00:08:38.781 --> 00:08:45.451
The next morning they took an aeroplane to Sydney.

00:08:45.511 --> 00:08:57.002
A taxi took them from the airport to Commander Zadak's office, some kilometers north of Sydney.

00:08:57.062 --> 00:09:03.134
Wait for us here, Kia said to the taxi driver.

00:09:03.194 --> 00:09:07.136
Kia and Rilla walked to the gate.

00:09:07.196 --> 00:09:12.238
About 10 guards stood in front of the gate.

00:09:12.298 --> 00:09:16.770
Across the road, a train waited.

00:09:16.830 --> 00:09:26.746
RillaOM45 Rilla said, to see Commander Zeddak at 4.30.

00:09:26.806 --> 00:09:32.680
Let me call the commander's office, the guard said.

00:09:32.740 --> 00:09:36.592
Kia and Rilla waited.

00:09:36.652 --> 00:09:42.116
It was hot and Kia began to feel thirsty.

00:09:42.176 --> 00:09:44.907
The guard came back.

00:09:44.967 --> 00:09:47.768
I'm sorry," he said.

00:09:47.828 --> 00:09:50.490
The commander can't see you.

00:09:50.550 --> 00:09:56.192
But I talked to the commander yesterday, Rilla said.

00:09:56.252 --> 00:10:00.174
He wanted to see us at 4.30.

00:10:00.234 --> 00:10:07.226
The commander is leaving on the train in three minutes, the guard said.

00:10:07.286 --> 00:10:10.381
Can we wait and see him here?

00:10:10.441 --> 00:10:12.396
Keir asked.

00:10:12.456 --> 00:10:13.876
No.

00:10:13.936 --> 00:10:16.128
The guard shouted.

00:10:16.188 --> 00:10:19.031
Get out of here.

00:10:19.091 --> 00:10:23.916
Keir and Rilla walked back to the taxi.

00:10:23.976 --> 00:10:25.827
Where's the driver?

00:10:25.887 --> 00:10:27.592
Keir asked.

00:10:27.652 --> 00:10:29.046
Look!

00:10:29.106 --> 00:10:31.558
He's sitting by that wall!"

00:10:31.618 --> 00:10:33.399
Rilla said.

00:10:33.459 --> 00:10:38.772
Just then, Commander Zadak came out of the gate.

00:10:38.832 --> 00:10:46.366
He was a very tall, big man with blue eyes and a lot of white hair.

00:10:46.426 --> 00:10:54.421
Two guards marched in front of him, and two guards marched behind him.

00:10:54.480 --> 00:10:58.302
They all carried guns.

00:10:58.362 --> 00:11:00.744
There he is!

00:11:00.804 --> 00:11:02.424
Rillakride.

00:11:02.484 --> 00:11:04.456
Commander!

00:11:04.516 --> 00:11:09.058
And she began to run along the road to him.

00:11:09.118 --> 00:11:12.670
Commander Zadak did not stop.

00:11:12.730 --> 00:11:18.754
A guard opened the door of the train and the commander got in.

00:11:18.814 --> 00:11:23.126
Slowly the train began to move.

00:11:23.186 --> 00:11:27.864
Kia ran to the taxi and jumped in.

00:11:27.924 --> 00:11:33.034
Then he drove the taxi fast down the road.

00:11:33.094 --> 00:11:38.788
The taxi driver saw him and ran after him.

00:11:38.848 --> 00:11:43.821
The train began to move faster.

00:11:43.881 --> 00:11:49.815
Suddenly, Keir drove the taxi off the road.

00:11:49.876 --> 00:11:54.829
He drove in front of the train and stopped.

00:11:54.889 --> 00:11:58.302
The train came nearer.

00:11:58.362 --> 00:12:08.098
And then the train stopped, very near the taxi, and some guards jumped off.

00:12:08.158 --> 00:12:14.422
Kia opened the door and got out of the taxi.

00:12:14.483 --> 00:12:19.756
Put up your hands, the guards shouted.

00:12:19.816 --> 00:12:23.816
Two of the guards began to hit Kia.

00:12:23.876 --> 00:12:27.897
Stop that, someone shouted.

00:12:27.956 --> 00:12:30.738
Bring him over here.

00:12:30.798 --> 00:12:34.220
It was Commander Zadak.

00:12:34.280 --> 00:12:38.062
Kia stood in front of the Commander.

00:12:38.122 --> 00:12:42.004
Just then, Rila arrived.

00:12:42.064 --> 00:12:44.546
Oh, it's you.

00:12:44.606 --> 00:12:47.156
Commander Zadak said.

00:12:47.216 --> 00:12:49.588
He did not smile.

00:12:49.647 --> 00:12:54.557
Rila, your father's going to be angry.

00:12:54.617 --> 00:12:59.947
We want to talk to you, Commander, Rilla said.

00:13:00.007 --> 00:13:02.868
It's very important.

00:13:02.928 --> 00:13:04.820
Very well.

00:13:04.880 --> 00:13:06.802
I'm listening.

00:13:06.862 --> 00:13:09.764
Kia began to talk.

00:13:09.824 --> 00:13:16.208
Two years ago, Adai told you about the holes in the AOL.

00:13:16.268 --> 00:13:18.620
Now they are worse.

00:13:18.680 --> 00:13:22.978
The AOL is breaking up over Europe.

00:13:23.038 --> 00:13:27.906
Please look at these numbers and this satellite picture.

00:13:27.966 --> 00:13:35.300
He gave his book to Commander Zadak and the Commander looked at the numbers.

00:13:35.360 --> 00:13:38.481
It's important, Commander.

00:13:38.541 --> 00:13:45.384
Kia said, in ten years Earth is going to die.

00:13:45.444 --> 00:13:49.265
You stop my train because of this?

00:13:49.325 --> 00:13:52.119
Commander Zadak asked.

00:13:52.179 --> 00:13:58.165
Two years ago, Adai talked to me about the AOL.

00:13:58.225 --> 00:14:01.517
Then he talked to Earth Commander.

00:14:01.577 --> 00:14:03.318
And what happened?

00:14:03.378 --> 00:14:05.709
Where is Adai now?

00:14:05.770 --> 00:14:10.052
Is the moon colony helping the AOL?

00:14:10.112 --> 00:14:15.304
We know about Adai Commander, Rilla said.

00:14:15.364 --> 00:14:20.181
But someone needs to talk to Earth Commander again.

00:14:20.241 --> 00:14:23.936
I'm going to talk to Gog about rain.

00:14:23.996 --> 00:14:25.976
I can tell you that.

00:14:26.036 --> 00:14:28.736
Earth needs rain.

00:14:28.796 --> 00:14:31.697
There was no rain last winter.

00:14:31.757 --> 00:14:37.748
Earth of Australia has no water and my trees here are dying.

00:14:37.808 --> 00:14:42.299
Without rain, many people are going to die.

00:14:42.359 --> 00:14:45.750
Is Gog going to understand that?

00:14:45.810 --> 00:14:47.894
I don't know.

00:14:47.954 --> 00:14:52.760
Commander Zadak began to walk back to his train.

00:14:52.820 --> 00:14:57.594
Move that taxi, he called to his guards.

00:14:57.654 --> 00:15:04.728
Some guards moved the taxi back to the road, and then they jumped onto the train again.

00:15:04.788 --> 00:15:07.872
The train began to move.

00:15:07.932 --> 00:15:12.044
Okay, the taxi driver shouted.

00:15:12.104 --> 00:15:14.526
What are you going to do next?

00:15:14.586 --> 00:15:17.756
Drive my taxi into the river?

00:15:17.816 --> 00:15:20.144
Keir smiled.

00:15:20.204 --> 00:15:25.626
He took some money from his pocket and gave it to the taxi driver.

00:15:25.686 --> 00:15:29.198
The taxi driver looked at the money.

00:15:29.258 --> 00:15:33.171
Okay, okay, he said.

00:15:33.231 --> 00:15:34.622
Where now?

00:15:34.682 --> 00:15:36.802
Back to the airport?

00:15:36.862 --> 00:15:39.394
Keir took Rilla's hand.

00:15:39.454 --> 00:15:41.715
Yes, he said.

00:15:41.775 --> 00:15:44.166
Let's get back to Kisangani.

00:15:44.226 --> 00:15:56.556
We can phone a die again tomorrow.

00:15:56.616 --> 00:16:21.131
Chapter 3 Earth Commander The next day in Kisangani, Keir and Rilla waited quietly in an office in Gorg's house.

00:16:21.191 --> 00:16:31.957
Suddenly, Commander Zadak came into the office and gave some letters to the man behind the table.

00:16:32.017 --> 00:16:38.180
He saw the two young people and stopped in front of them.

00:16:38.240 --> 00:16:41.890
You again, he said.

00:16:41.950 --> 00:16:45.002
What are you doing here?

00:16:45.062 --> 00:16:47.462
Kia stood up.

00:16:47.522 --> 00:16:50.136
Good morning, Commander.

00:16:50.196 --> 00:16:54.700
We're here because we want to see Earth Commander.

00:16:54.760 --> 00:17:01.200
I saw Earth Commander some minutes ago and talked to him about rain.

00:17:01.260 --> 00:17:06.599
Sadak said quietly, but he didn't listen.

00:17:06.659 --> 00:17:16.128
Your Captain Seru was here earlier this morning and began to tell him about the holes in the AOL.

00:17:16.188 --> 00:17:20.542
But Gog doesn't want to hear about our planet.

00:17:20.602 --> 00:17:23.915
He's always talking about Mars.

00:17:23.974 --> 00:17:28.739
In the end, he's going to destroy Earth.

00:17:28.799 --> 00:17:33.701
Please help us, Rilla cried.

00:17:33.761 --> 00:17:36.752
Come and see Gog with us.

00:17:36.812 --> 00:17:38.782
No.

00:17:38.842 --> 00:17:44.804
Sadak looked at Keir and then at Rilla with his blue eyes.

00:17:44.865 --> 00:17:48.046
I'm not talking to Gog again.

00:17:48.106 --> 00:17:52.927
And you, Gog isn't going to listen to you.

00:17:52.987 --> 00:17:57.260
Be careful and good luck.

00:17:57.320 --> 00:18:03.692
Commander Zadak opened the door and left the office.

00:18:03.752 --> 00:18:07.244
Rilla looked at Keir.

00:18:07.304 --> 00:18:10.404
Earth Commander is a difficult man.

00:18:10.424 --> 00:18:13.735
I don't understand him.

00:18:13.795 --> 00:18:16.726
Everyone is afraid of him.

00:18:16.786 --> 00:18:18.386
Keir said.

00:18:18.446 --> 00:18:22.780
And Commander Zadak isn't going to help us.

00:18:22.840 --> 00:18:25.914
Keir and Rilla waited.

00:18:25.974 --> 00:18:29.168
They waited and waited.

00:18:29.228 --> 00:18:34.942
At nearly twelve o'clock, a guard came into the office.

00:18:35.002 --> 00:18:38.764
Come, he said.

00:18:38.824 --> 00:18:42.948
Keir and Rilla went with the guard.

00:18:43.008 --> 00:18:49.443
The house was big and old, with big windows and many doors.

00:18:49.504 --> 00:18:55.073
The guard went downstairs and opened one of the doors.

00:18:55.133 --> 00:18:58.328
There was nobody in the room.

00:18:58.388 --> 00:19:04.206
Wait here, the guard said, and left.

00:19:04.266 --> 00:19:15.267
Keir and Rilla sat down on the expensive green and black chairs and looked at the expensive flowers on the tables.

00:19:15.327 --> 00:19:18.818
There were no windows in this room.

00:19:18.878 --> 00:19:26.090
Suddenly the door opened and a tall fat woman came in.

00:19:26.150 --> 00:19:31.138
Her name was Belle and she was Gog's wife.

00:19:31.198 --> 00:19:38.337
She had a lot of long red hair and she wore an expensive blue dress.

00:19:38.398 --> 00:19:42.199
Bell liked expensive things.

00:19:42.259 --> 00:19:44.740
She carried a cat.

00:19:44.800 --> 00:19:48.351
The cat was black and white.

00:19:48.411 --> 00:19:54.023
Half its face was black and half was white.

00:19:54.083 --> 00:19:59.751
Half its body was black and half was white.

00:19:59.812 --> 00:20:02.458
Why are you here?

00:20:02.518 --> 00:20:05.579
Why do you want to see Earth Commander?"

00:20:05.639 --> 00:20:07.630
she asked.

00:20:07.690 --> 00:20:10.080
Rilla stood up.

00:20:10.140 --> 00:20:11.970
How do you do?

00:20:12.030 --> 00:20:13.791
She said.

00:20:13.851 --> 00:20:18.822
We want to talk to Earth Commander about the AOL.

00:20:18.882 --> 00:20:23.023
We have new numbers from the satellite.

00:20:23.083 --> 00:20:26.124
Bell's face was red.

00:20:26.184 --> 00:20:28.247
The AOL?

00:20:28.307 --> 00:20:35.382
Earth Commander knows about the AOL, and he is the best man.

00:20:35.442 --> 00:20:39.964
Excuse me, Kia said quietly.

00:20:40.024 --> 00:20:43.766
We want to help Earth Commander.

00:20:43.826 --> 00:20:46.738
Bell began to laugh.

00:20:46.798 --> 00:20:49.018
Help!

00:20:49.038 --> 00:20:49.788
You!

00:20:49.848 --> 00:20:53.729
The cat jumped down and walked across the room.

00:20:53.789 --> 00:20:56.319
How can you help?

00:20:56.339 --> 00:20:58.350
Or can't you understand?

00:20:58.410 --> 00:21:03.794
Listen, Earth Commander is working on the spaceship for Mars.

00:21:03.854 --> 00:21:07.375
It's difficult and expensive work."

00:21:07.436 --> 00:21:13.349
The cat jumped onto Rilla's chair and looked at her with its yellow eyes.

00:21:13.409 --> 00:21:27.101
Two years ago, a guy wanted more money for the AOL, and Earth Commander sent him to the colony under the moon Now you're talking about the AOL.

00:21:27.161 --> 00:21:30.352
Do you want to go to the moon too?

00:21:30.412 --> 00:21:35.843
The door opened again, and a different guard came in.

00:21:35.903 --> 00:21:37.494
Excuse me.

00:21:37.554 --> 00:21:40.094
Earth Commander is ready now.

00:21:40.154 --> 00:21:42.175
Bell stood up.

00:21:42.235 --> 00:21:47.416
You can see Earth Commander now, she said coldly.

00:21:47.476 --> 00:21:51.172
But you're going to be sorry.

00:21:51.232 --> 00:22:03.064
The guard opened a different door, and Bell and the cat went into a beautiful room with expensive, very old tables and chairs.

00:22:03.125 --> 00:22:07.048
Rilla and Keir went in behind them.

00:22:07.108 --> 00:22:11.940
There were no windows in the room, but a lot of pictures.

00:22:12.000 --> 00:22:20.166
There was Gog, the richest man on earth, and the worst man on earth.

00:22:20.226 --> 00:22:25.318
He was tall and fat and without much hair.

00:22:25.378 --> 00:22:32.979
He sat behind a big table with a television, three computers and five telephones.

00:22:33.039 --> 00:22:39.150
He watched the television and didn't look at Keir or Rilla.

00:22:39.210 --> 00:22:46.442
Two guards with guns stood behind him and two more guards stood near the door.

00:22:46.502 --> 00:22:50.339
Here they are, Bell said.

00:22:50.399 --> 00:22:52.427
They aren't friends.

00:22:52.487 --> 00:22:53.968
Oh, no.

00:22:54.028 --> 00:22:58.181
They want to talk about the AOL, of course.

00:22:58.241 --> 00:23:01.503
No one understands about Mars.

00:23:01.563 --> 00:23:04.064
That's all right, that's all right."

00:23:04.125 --> 00:23:06.476
Gorg said quickly.

00:23:06.536 --> 00:23:08.768
And then he looked up.

00:23:08.828 --> 00:23:12.730
First at Rilla, and then at Keir.

00:23:12.790 --> 00:23:16.062
His eyes were cold and green.

00:23:16.122 --> 00:23:20.412
I know about you too," he said.

00:23:20.472 --> 00:23:23.433
Your captain told me about you.

00:23:23.493 --> 00:23:28.044
Your famous two children.

00:23:28.104 --> 00:23:31.255
You want to help Planet Earth?

00:23:31.315 --> 00:23:32.976
Is that right?

00:23:33.036 --> 00:23:34.846
He waited.

00:23:34.906 --> 00:23:41.864
The cat jumped onto his table and sat down in front of the television.

00:23:41.924 --> 00:23:44.350
Yes, Commander.

00:23:44.410 --> 00:23:46.210
Here began.

00:23:46.270 --> 00:23:49.392
The AOL is breaking up.

00:23:49.452 --> 00:23:50.462
When?

00:23:50.522 --> 00:23:51.342
Tonight?

00:23:51.402 --> 00:23:52.683
Tomorrow?

00:23:52.743 --> 00:23:55.184
Gog said angrily.

00:23:55.244 --> 00:24:00.106
I heard this old story two years ago from Adai.

00:24:00.166 --> 00:24:03.928
Everyone comes here and wants money.

00:24:03.988 --> 00:24:06.298
Money for the AOL.

00:24:06.358 --> 00:24:08.179
Money for rain.

00:24:08.239 --> 00:24:10.981
Money for the moon colony.

00:24:11.042 --> 00:24:16.884
But I am Earth Commander, and you are nobody.

00:24:16.944 --> 00:24:24.555
I know about the AOL, and the AOL is good for a hundred years.

00:24:24.615 --> 00:24:28.876
But the satellite, here began again.

00:24:28.936 --> 00:24:32.266
Big quiet, cog cried.

00:24:32.327 --> 00:24:35.007
I am Earth Commander.

00:24:35.067 --> 00:24:40.820
I'm not going to give money for the AOL, or for rain.

00:24:40.880 --> 00:24:43.504
or for the moon.

00:24:43.564 --> 00:24:47.146
Gog looked at the guards near the door.

00:24:47.206 --> 00:24:48.818
Take them.

00:24:48.878 --> 00:24:50.970
Take them away.

00:24:51.030 --> 00:24:54.602
I don't want to hear them.

00:24:54.662 --> 00:25:01.706
The guards moved behind Keir and Rilla, and Bell began to laugh.

00:25:01.767 --> 00:25:04.959
Good-bye, she said.

00:25:05.019 --> 00:25:07.651
You're not going to the moon?

00:25:07.711 --> 00:25:10.685
You're going to prison.

00:25:10.745 --> 00:25:16.748
You can talk about the holes in the AOL there.

00:25:16.808 --> 00:25:19.669
Chapter 4.

00:25:19.729 --> 00:25:23.280
Prison 888.

00:25:23.340 --> 00:25:30.422
Commander Zarduk was in his room at the biggest hotel in Kisangani.

00:25:30.482 --> 00:25:34.762
Suddenly, he heard the phone.

00:25:34.822 --> 00:25:37.334
Commander.

00:25:37.394 --> 00:25:40.794
Someone said very quietly.

00:25:40.855 --> 00:25:50.842
a man and a woman, from ship OM45 in prison 888.

00:25:50.902 --> 00:25:54.264
The phone went dead.

00:25:54.324 --> 00:26:01.200
Zaduk put the phone down, stood up and left his room.

00:26:01.260 --> 00:26:09.397
Prison 888 was a big white building without windows near Gog's house.

00:26:09.457 --> 00:26:17.395
There were a lot of guards at the gate, and some more guards marched past the building.

00:26:17.455 --> 00:26:21.758
All the guards carried guns.

00:26:21.818 --> 00:26:27.723
Commander Zadak walked across the road to the prison.

00:26:27.784 --> 00:26:30.596
I want to visit someone.

00:26:30.656 --> 00:26:34.039
My name is Commander Zadak.

00:26:34.099 --> 00:26:38.032
I'm sorry, Commander," a guard said.

00:26:38.092 --> 00:26:40.304
We can't open the gate.

00:26:40.365 --> 00:26:44.888
Nobody can go in without a letter from Earth, Commander.

00:26:44.948 --> 00:26:52.465
That's all right, Zadek said, and walked along the road past the prison.

00:26:52.525 --> 00:26:55.548
A guard ran behind him.

00:26:55.608 --> 00:26:59.796
Excuse me, Commander, he said quickly.

00:26:59.856 --> 00:27:02.372
Please come back tonight.

00:27:02.432 --> 00:27:05.754
I can open the back gate at midnight.

00:27:05.814 --> 00:27:11.858
You can see the two people from ship OM45.

00:27:11.918 --> 00:27:15.020
Zadek looked at the guard.

00:27:15.080 --> 00:27:18.122
Your captain is going to kill you.

00:27:18.182 --> 00:27:20.784
The guard smiled.

00:27:20.844 --> 00:27:27.008
My captain phoned you about the two people from OM45.

00:27:27.068 --> 00:27:31.264
He's the brother of Captain Seru.

00:27:31.324 --> 00:27:34.569
Zadak didn't smile.

00:27:34.629 --> 00:27:40.584
The prison commander is going to kill you and your captain.

00:27:40.644 --> 00:27:44.357
It doesn't matter, the guard said.

00:27:44.418 --> 00:27:46.840
We want to help.

00:27:46.900 --> 00:27:53.175
Midnight, Zadak said, and walked away.

00:27:53.236 --> 00:28:04.375
At midnight, there were four guards at the front gate of Prison 888, and there was one guard at the back gate.

00:28:04.435 --> 00:28:09.809
The guard opened the gate, and Sadak went in.

00:28:09.869 --> 00:28:13.402
The guard said nothing.

00:28:13.462 --> 00:28:18.227
They walked downstairs into a big room.

00:28:18.287 --> 00:28:25.872
A lot of prisoners slept on the floor because there were no beds or chairs.

00:28:25.932 --> 00:28:31.714
Kia and Rilla sat on the floor near the door.

00:28:31.774 --> 00:28:35.324
You can talk for five minutes.

00:28:35.384 --> 00:28:38.276
The guard said quietly.

00:28:38.336 --> 00:28:43.408
The next guard arrives at 12.15.

00:28:43.468 --> 00:28:47.015
Kia and Rilla stood up.

00:28:47.075 --> 00:28:51.475
Good evening, Commander," they said.

00:28:51.535 --> 00:28:54.958
Zaduk looked at the prisoners.

00:28:55.019 --> 00:28:58.082
Why are all these people here?

00:28:58.142 --> 00:29:00.834
He said to Kia and Rinna.

00:29:00.894 --> 00:29:04.688
They're in prison because Gog doesn't like them.

00:29:04.748 --> 00:29:07.440
I talked to Gog about rain.

00:29:07.500 --> 00:29:12.512
I talked to him about the AOL, but he never listens.

00:29:12.572 --> 00:29:24.186
Today, someone told me about some fires in the new forest here in Africa, but Gog doesn't want to hear about those fires."

00:29:24.246 --> 00:29:27.397
Zadek laughed angrily.

00:29:27.457 --> 00:29:32.410
And he doesn't want to hear about my trees in Australia.

00:29:32.470 --> 00:29:35.032
He never listens to me.

00:29:35.092 --> 00:29:42.424
He's always thinking about Mars, not about our beautiful planet Earth.

00:29:42.484 --> 00:29:46.086
Kia listened carefully.

00:29:46.146 --> 00:29:49.140
Take it easy, Commander.

00:29:49.200 --> 00:29:51.402
He said quietly.

00:29:51.462 --> 00:29:54.254
Please talk to Adai.

00:29:54.315 --> 00:29:56.436
Adai wants to help.

00:29:56.496 --> 00:30:00.340
He can come back from the moon and help you.

00:30:00.400 --> 00:30:06.756
Now, Sadak said, I found Adai this afternoon.

00:30:06.816 --> 00:30:11.981
He's a good man and he wants to help, but I don't need help.

00:30:12.040 --> 00:30:14.762
I'm going to stop Gog.

00:30:14.822 --> 00:30:17.795
I'm going to kill him."

00:30:17.855 --> 00:30:21.879
Kia closed his eyes for a minute.

00:30:21.939 --> 00:30:25.212
Gog's guards have guns.

00:30:25.272 --> 00:30:29.566
They can kill you, Commander, he said.

00:30:29.625 --> 00:30:32.658
You need more people to help.

00:30:32.718 --> 00:30:34.809
Wait for a die.

00:30:34.870 --> 00:30:38.561
He can help you to look for more people.

00:30:38.621 --> 00:30:43.483
No care, Zadek said quietly.

00:30:43.543 --> 00:30:46.224
I don't want more people.

00:30:46.284 --> 00:30:50.536
A die can come back to earth after Gog is dead.

00:30:50.596 --> 00:30:53.247
After I'm dead, perhaps.

00:30:53.307 --> 00:30:57.090
I don't want a die to die too.

00:30:57.150 --> 00:31:00.032
Excuse me, Commander.

00:31:00.092 --> 00:31:01.804
The guard said.

00:31:01.864 --> 00:31:04.686
He looked at the clock near the door.

00:31:04.746 --> 00:31:07.208
Okay, let's go.

00:31:07.269 --> 00:31:09.910
Zadak said to the guard.

00:31:09.971 --> 00:31:13.694
He looked at Rilla, and then at Keir.

00:31:13.754 --> 00:31:16.456
His eyes were very blue.

00:31:16.516 --> 00:31:20.200
Goodbye, he said.

00:31:20.260 --> 00:31:22.862
Goodbye, Commander.

00:31:22.922 --> 00:31:24.813
Keir said.

00:31:24.873 --> 00:31:26.864
Be careful.

00:31:26.924 --> 00:31:31.876
Rilla cried, and good luck.

00:31:31.936 --> 00:31:38.449
Early that morning, Earth Commander's house was quiet.

00:31:38.509 --> 00:31:41.700
A guard opened the door.

00:31:41.760 --> 00:31:45.751
Good morning, Commander Zadek, he said.

00:31:45.812 --> 00:31:48.952
Earth Commander isn't in his office.

00:31:49.012 --> 00:31:52.274
That's all right, Zadek said.

00:31:52.334 --> 00:31:54.380
I can wait.

00:31:54.440 --> 00:31:58.508
Zadek went upstairs and waited.

00:31:58.568 --> 00:32:03.338
At eight o'clock, Bell came into the room.

00:32:03.398 --> 00:32:07.439
Good morning, Commander, she said.

00:32:07.499 --> 00:32:09.980
You're early this morning.

00:32:10.040 --> 00:32:11.980
Are you happier today?

00:32:12.000 --> 00:32:17.121
Earth Commander was fairly angry with you yesterday.

00:32:17.181 --> 00:32:22.492
Don't begin talking about the ring or the AOL today.

00:32:22.552 --> 00:32:27.976
Zadak smiled, but his blue eyes were cold.

00:32:28.036 --> 00:32:35.100
No, he said, I'm not going to talk about rain today.

00:32:35.160 --> 00:32:39.333
Just then, Gog came into the room.

00:32:39.393 --> 00:32:42.034
He looked at Zadak.

00:32:42.094 --> 00:32:44.246
What's wrong?

00:32:44.306 --> 00:32:48.728
Why are you here at eight o'clock in the morning?

00:32:48.788 --> 00:32:53.008
Zadak took his gun from his pocket.

00:32:53.068 --> 00:32:57.658
Gog saw the gun, and his face went white.

00:32:57.718 --> 00:33:01.150
His eyes were dark and afraid.

00:33:01.211 --> 00:33:05.744
For a second, nobody moved.

00:33:05.804 --> 00:33:12.380
Suddenly, Bell's black and white cat ran into the room.

00:33:12.440 --> 00:33:13.821
God's!

00:33:13.881 --> 00:33:15.212
God's!

00:33:15.272 --> 00:33:17.154
Bell shouted.

00:33:17.214 --> 00:33:23.823
The cat jumped at Zadak, and Zadak hit the cat away from him.

00:33:23.883 --> 00:33:32.420
Bell ran across the room to Gog, and Zadak at that second shot at Gog.

00:33:32.480 --> 00:33:35.941
But Bell was between him and Gog.

00:33:36.001 --> 00:33:40.642
She gave a cry and fell to the floor.

00:33:40.702 --> 00:33:46.834
Her hair looked very red on the black floor.

00:33:46.854 --> 00:33:47.334
No!

00:33:47.394 --> 00:33:49.084
Gog cried.

00:33:49.144 --> 00:33:51.836
You shot Bell!

00:33:51.896 --> 00:33:59.050
Three guards ran into the room with their big guns and stood in front of Gog.

00:33:59.110 --> 00:34:01.192
Kill him!

00:34:01.252 --> 00:34:06.085
Gog shouted and began to help Bell.

00:34:06.145 --> 00:34:11.598
Zadek looked at the guards and then at Bell and Gog.

00:34:11.658 --> 00:34:13.809
Kia was right.

00:34:13.870 --> 00:34:16.771
He was going to die.

00:34:16.832 --> 00:34:19.475
I'm sorry Kia.

00:34:19.535 --> 00:34:24.690
I'm sorry, Adai," he said quietly.

00:34:24.750 --> 00:34:28.782
The guards shot Zadak.

00:34:28.842 --> 00:34:37.698
Slowly, he fell to the floor.

00:34:37.758 --> 00:34:48.365
Later that morning, four guards took Rilla to Gog's office.

00:34:48.425 --> 00:34:53.386
His face looked tired, and his eyes were red.

00:34:53.446 --> 00:34:57.726
Leave us, he said to the guards.

00:34:57.786 --> 00:35:00.757
Then he looked at Rilla.

00:35:00.817 --> 00:35:03.698
Tell me about Kia.

00:35:03.758 --> 00:35:06.588
When did you first meet him?

00:35:06.648 --> 00:35:09.368
Is Zadak his friend?

00:35:09.428 --> 00:35:12.710
What do they talk about?

00:35:12.770 --> 00:35:17.595
Rilla looked down at the floor and said nothing.

00:35:17.655 --> 00:35:20.209
Come on, tell me.

00:35:20.269 --> 00:35:23.243
Gog said angrily.

00:35:23.303 --> 00:35:28.070
He waited, but Rilla said nothing.

00:35:28.130 --> 00:35:31.465
Tell me about Zadak then.

00:35:31.525 --> 00:35:35.988
Your father and Commander Zadak were friends.

00:35:36.048 --> 00:35:40.702
Now, you're talking to Zadak about the AOL.

00:35:40.763 --> 00:35:42.313
I know that.

00:35:42.374 --> 00:35:45.566
What is Zadak saying?

00:35:45.626 --> 00:35:47.487
Why?

00:35:47.548 --> 00:35:51.290
Why do you want to know about Commander Zadak?

00:35:51.350 --> 00:35:53.552
Rilla asked.

00:35:53.612 --> 00:35:57.174
I'm asking the questions, not you.

00:35:57.234 --> 00:35:58.806
Gog said.

00:35:58.866 --> 00:36:02.398
Did you see Zadak yesterday?

00:36:02.458 --> 00:36:10.065
The AOL is important, not Commander Zadak, Rilla said.

00:36:10.125 --> 00:36:14.119
Gog watched Rilla carefully.

00:36:14.179 --> 00:36:17.972
Zadak is dead.

00:36:18.032 --> 00:36:19.904
No!

00:36:19.964 --> 00:36:21.815
Rilla cried.

00:36:21.876 --> 00:36:24.274
He is dead.

00:36:24.334 --> 00:36:26.640
Gog said again.

00:36:26.700 --> 00:36:32.153
You lost your friend here in this building early this morning.

00:36:32.213 --> 00:36:35.214
My guards shot him.

00:36:35.274 --> 00:36:38.395
Rilla's face went white.

00:36:38.455 --> 00:36:40.446
What happened?

00:36:40.506 --> 00:36:42.396
Tell me.

00:36:42.456 --> 00:36:45.678
I'm going to tell you one thing.

00:36:45.738 --> 00:36:47.998
Gog said angrily.

00:36:48.058 --> 00:36:51.867
I'm going to destroy Australia.

00:36:51.927 --> 00:36:56.487
I'm going to burn Zadak's new forest there.

00:36:56.548 --> 00:37:00.103
You can tell all your friends.

00:37:00.164 --> 00:37:05.888
Zadak wanted to kill me, but I killed him.

00:37:05.948 --> 00:37:13.812
He wanted money for rain, money for the AOL, and now he's dead.

00:37:13.872 --> 00:37:19.054
You can tell all those prisoners in prison 888.

00:37:19.114 --> 00:37:23.878
They wanted to stop me, but they can't now.

00:37:23.938 --> 00:37:26.906
I'm going to Mars.

00:37:26.966 --> 00:37:30.916
Bell always wanted to go to Mars.

00:37:30.976 --> 00:37:34.830
He began to hit the table with his hand.

00:37:34.890 --> 00:37:38.924
I'm going to leave this dead planet.

00:37:38.984 --> 00:37:41.977
Nobody can stop me.

00:37:42.037 --> 00:37:45.962
You're crazy, Rina said.

00:37:46.022 --> 00:37:51.816
You killed Sadak, but one day someone is going to kill you.

00:37:51.876 --> 00:37:54.395
Gog stood up.

00:37:54.455 --> 00:37:58.246
His face was tired and he looked ill.

00:37:58.306 --> 00:38:01.396
Be quiet, he said.

00:38:01.456 --> 00:38:04.597
Guards take her away.

00:38:04.657 --> 00:38:08.007
Back to 888.

00:38:08.068 --> 00:38:12.438
The guards came in and took Rilla out.

00:38:12.498 --> 00:38:14.739
What happened?

00:38:14.799 --> 00:38:16.509
She asked them.

00:38:16.569 --> 00:38:19.390
Commander Zadak is dead.

00:38:19.450 --> 00:38:22.823
Why is Gog angry?

00:38:22.883 --> 00:38:37.588
The guards said nothing, but after they returned to the gate of 888, a guard said to Rilla very quietly, Bell is dead.

00:38:37.648 --> 00:38:45.354
Zaduk didn't shoot Gog, but he shot Bell before the guards shot him.

00:38:45.414 --> 00:38:52.536
A guard took Rilla into the prison, and soon she was with Kia again.

00:38:52.596 --> 00:38:54.601
What happened?

00:38:54.662 --> 00:38:56.162
Kia asked.

00:38:56.222 --> 00:38:57.902
Tell me.

00:38:57.962 --> 00:39:03.234
Rilla put her hands over her face and began to cry.

00:39:03.294 --> 00:39:07.706
Zadak is dead, she began.

00:39:07.766 --> 00:39:10.537
He didn't kill Gog.

00:39:10.597 --> 00:39:14.968
He killed Bell before the guards shot him.

00:39:15.029 --> 00:39:20.548
And now Gog is going to destroy Australia.

00:39:20.608 --> 00:39:24.996
Kia sat down on the floor next to Rilla.

00:39:25.056 --> 00:39:27.847
His face was sad.

00:39:27.907 --> 00:39:30.088
Don't cry.

00:39:30.148 --> 00:39:33.158
He said quietly.

00:39:33.218 --> 00:39:38.260
Three or four prisoners came across the room.

00:39:38.320 --> 00:39:40.420
What's the matter?

00:39:40.480 --> 00:39:42.311
They asked.

00:39:42.371 --> 00:39:44.692
Zadak is dead.

00:39:44.752 --> 00:39:49.248
Kia said, but Bell is dead too.

00:39:49.308 --> 00:39:52.004
What's going to happen next?"

00:39:52.065 --> 00:39:57.286
Someone asked, but nobody answered.

00:39:57.346 --> 00:40:08.039
The next afternoon, Captain Seru's brother took Kia and Rila to a little room at the back of the prison.

00:40:08.099 --> 00:40:14.970
They sat down, and five minutes later, Captain Seru arrived.

00:40:15.031 --> 00:40:17.804
Nobody smiled.

00:40:17.864 --> 00:40:22.778
You are right, Captain," Kia said.

00:40:22.838 --> 00:40:29.332
Gog sent us to prison because we told him about the holes in the AOL.

00:40:29.392 --> 00:40:32.243
Seru smiled.

00:40:32.303 --> 00:40:36.144
You were right, Kia, she said.

00:40:36.204 --> 00:40:39.506
Those satellite numbers were very bad.

00:40:39.566 --> 00:40:44.461
I began to tell Gog, but he didn't listen to me.

00:40:44.521 --> 00:40:48.496
Would you like some coffee and some sandwiches?"

00:40:48.556 --> 00:40:50.790
Seru's brother asked.

00:40:50.850 --> 00:40:54.172
Yes, please, Seru said.

00:40:54.232 --> 00:40:56.324
I'm hungry.

00:40:56.384 --> 00:40:59.418
She looked at Kea and Rilla.

00:40:59.478 --> 00:41:02.950
Things are very bad.

00:41:03.010 --> 00:41:04.952
What's happening?

00:41:05.013 --> 00:41:06.874
Rilla asked.

00:41:06.935 --> 00:41:10.362
You know about Zadak and Bell?

00:41:10.422 --> 00:41:16.060
Yes, Gog told Rila yesterday, Kia said.

00:41:16.120 --> 00:41:20.884
Seru smiled, but her eyes were not happy.

00:41:20.944 --> 00:41:25.576
Gog talked to me this morning, she said.

00:41:25.636 --> 00:41:32.280
Her brother came in with the coffee and sandwiches, and Seru began to eat.

00:41:32.341 --> 00:41:38.522
Gog wants to know about Zadak and about you, she said.

00:41:38.582 --> 00:41:44.145
He's going to kill us all, I think, before he goes to Mars.

00:41:44.205 --> 00:41:48.478
Suddenly, Rilla felt ill.

00:41:48.538 --> 00:41:52.592
I can't eat now, she cried.

00:41:52.652 --> 00:41:56.274
But she took some coffee and began to drink.

00:41:56.334 --> 00:42:00.138
Let's get out of here, she said.

00:42:00.198 --> 00:42:05.222
Perhaps we can get a plane to Brazil and go to my family.

00:42:05.282 --> 00:42:08.688
Difficult, Saru said.

00:42:08.748 --> 00:42:16.086
Last night, fires began in the new forest in Europe, and they're moving across Europe.

00:42:16.146 --> 00:42:19.958
The fires in Africa are burning fast.

00:42:20.018 --> 00:42:25.650
Gog began to destroy Zadak's forest in Australia yesterday.

00:42:25.710 --> 00:42:28.252
Did you phone a die?

00:42:28.312 --> 00:42:30.024
Keir asked.

00:42:30.084 --> 00:42:31.674
A die?

00:42:31.734 --> 00:42:34.684
You never stopped talking about a die.

00:42:34.745 --> 00:42:36.364
What can he do?"

00:42:36.424 --> 00:42:37.814
Rilla said.

00:42:37.874 --> 00:42:40.524
She felt angry.

00:42:40.584 --> 00:42:44.046
Saru looked at Rilla for a minute.

00:42:44.106 --> 00:42:47.897
Yes, I phoned a die before I came here.

00:42:47.957 --> 00:42:52.759
I told him about Zadak and Bell and about the fires.

00:42:52.819 --> 00:42:55.690
He asked about you, Kia.

00:42:55.750 --> 00:43:02.658
He can't come down at Kisan Gani Airport because Gog is there with a lot of his guards.

00:43:02.718 --> 00:43:08.157
Ship Marsfall is nearly ready, and Gog is watching it.

00:43:08.217 --> 00:43:11.968
He wants to leave Earth tomorrow.

00:43:12.028 --> 00:43:15.140
How can a die help us?

00:43:15.200 --> 00:43:16.610
Rilla asked.

00:43:16.670 --> 00:43:19.952
He can't shoot all the guards here.

00:43:20.012 --> 00:43:24.023
Captain Seru finished the last sandwich.

00:43:24.083 --> 00:43:27.594
Let's leave that to a die, she said.

00:43:27.654 --> 00:43:30.209
We can do nothing.

00:43:30.269 --> 00:43:33.165
Are you going to stay here?"

00:43:33.225 --> 00:43:34.976
Kia asked.

00:43:35.036 --> 00:43:38.390
Yes, Saru answered.

00:43:38.450 --> 00:43:44.016
Adai is coming to the prison after he arrives on Earth.

00:43:44.076 --> 00:43:48.390
Oh yes, Rilla said tiredly.

00:43:48.450 --> 00:43:59.066
But when Gog can kill us before Adai comes, No, he can't, Seru's brother said.

00:43:59.126 --> 00:44:03.736
You can stay here, in this room.

00:44:03.797 --> 00:44:10.818
Gog's guards are all afraid, afraid of the fires, afraid of the people.

00:44:10.878 --> 00:44:14.838
They aren't going to look for you here.

00:44:14.899 --> 00:44:25.606
Chapter 6 Spaceship to the Moon And so they waited, and waited.

00:44:25.666 --> 00:44:28.764
Rilla slept in her chair.

00:44:28.824 --> 00:44:32.456
Kia and Seru talked quietly.

00:44:32.516 --> 00:44:35.628
Seru's brother came and went.

00:44:35.688 --> 00:44:40.830
Most of the prison guards ran away with the prisoners.

00:44:40.890 --> 00:44:53.658
Seven or eight people, some prisoners and some guards, didn't want to run away, so they came into the room and waited too.

00:44:53.718 --> 00:44:58.562
Ten o'clock came, then eleven o'clock.

00:44:58.622 --> 00:45:01.492
It was very quiet.

00:45:01.553 --> 00:45:05.284
Saru walked up and down the room.

00:45:05.344 --> 00:45:08.775
Keir sat next to Rila.

00:45:08.836 --> 00:45:13.098
Saru's brother came into the room again.

00:45:13.158 --> 00:45:17.410
It's after midnight, he said.

00:45:17.470 --> 00:45:22.022
Just then they heard the noise of a plane.

00:45:22.082 --> 00:45:24.502
Keir stood up.

00:45:24.562 --> 00:45:27.162
Come on, he said.

00:45:27.223 --> 00:45:30.083
Let's get out of the building.

00:45:30.144 --> 00:45:34.044
Quietly, they left the building.

00:45:34.104 --> 00:45:37.636
It was a dark, hot night.

00:45:37.696 --> 00:45:44.788
There were no guards in front of the prison, so they went to the gate and waited there.

00:45:44.848 --> 00:45:48.988
Suddenly, they saw the plane.

00:45:49.048 --> 00:45:55.442
It was a little plane, and it came down on the road in front of the prison.

00:45:55.502 --> 00:45:58.464
Rilla took Kia's hand.

00:45:58.524 --> 00:46:01.524
You were right, she said.

00:46:01.584 --> 00:46:03.715
I'm sorry.

00:46:03.775 --> 00:46:06.325
Kia smiled.

00:46:06.385 --> 00:46:09.416
He began to feel happy.

00:46:09.476 --> 00:46:11.516
That's all right.

00:46:11.576 --> 00:46:13.437
I understand.

00:46:13.497 --> 00:46:17.978
I know a guy very well and you don't.

00:46:18.038 --> 00:46:23.268
The plane stopped and someone opened the door.

00:46:23.328 --> 00:46:26.787
Keir ran across to the plane.

00:46:26.847 --> 00:46:30.248
How many can you take, he called.

00:46:30.308 --> 00:46:32.630
There are twelve of us.

00:46:32.690 --> 00:46:35.851
That's alright, someone said.

00:46:35.911 --> 00:46:38.752
Quickly, the spaceship is waiting.

00:46:38.812 --> 00:46:44.884
The twelve people got into the little plane and the plane began to move.

00:46:44.944 --> 00:46:48.556
Rilla looked at the captain of the plane.

00:46:48.616 --> 00:46:51.748
He was tall with brown hair.

00:46:51.808 --> 00:46:53.807
He looked nice.

00:46:53.867 --> 00:46:57.918
Was this the famous commander a die?

00:46:57.978 --> 00:47:00.490
Where is the spaceship?

00:47:00.550 --> 00:47:02.332
Kia asked.

00:47:02.392 --> 00:47:06.334
At the old airport, the Ma said.

00:47:06.394 --> 00:47:11.128
One of the fires is moving very quickly across the new forest.

00:47:11.188 --> 00:47:17.792
It's going to arrive at the west of Kisangani before tomorrow, I think.

00:47:17.852 --> 00:47:21.754
But the old airport is okay.

00:47:21.814 --> 00:47:27.118
Then the man looked at Keir and smiled warmly.

00:47:27.178 --> 00:47:35.142
My brother, he said, my little brother in prison 888.

00:47:35.202 --> 00:47:37.444
Your brother?

00:47:37.504 --> 00:47:39.575
Commander Adai?

00:47:39.635 --> 00:47:41.406
Rilla asked.

00:47:41.466 --> 00:47:44.478
But you didn't tell me that?

00:47:44.538 --> 00:47:46.812
Keir smiled.

00:47:46.872 --> 00:47:50.066
nobody knew, he said.

00:47:50.126 --> 00:47:53.930
But now, it doesn't matter now.

00:47:53.990 --> 00:47:57.171
Everyone can know."

00:47:57.231 --> 00:48:02.755
The little plane came down at the old airport, south of the town.

00:48:02.775 --> 00:48:07.358
"'Let's be careful,' Adai said.

00:48:07.418 --> 00:48:11.446
We don't want someone to shoot us before we leave.

00:48:11.506 --> 00:48:14.414
The spaceship was dark.

00:48:14.474 --> 00:48:21.898
Quickly, everyone jumped down from the plane and ran across to the spaceship.

00:48:21.958 --> 00:48:30.414
Soon, the spaceship left Earth, and everyone looked down at the burning planet.

00:48:30.474 --> 00:48:34.835
They saw the dark smoke of Africa.

00:48:34.896 --> 00:48:42.806
And here and there, through the smoke, the red, angry fires.

00:48:42.866 --> 00:48:49.393
The fires are destroying the forest very quickly, Saru said.

00:48:49.453 --> 00:48:53.504
Adai put his hand on Kia's arm.

00:48:53.565 --> 00:48:58.176
I'm sorry about Zadak, he said.

00:48:58.236 --> 00:49:00.797
I wanted him to wait.

00:49:00.857 --> 00:49:02.438
Kia said.

00:49:02.498 --> 00:49:05.908
I wanted him to talk to you.

00:49:05.968 --> 00:49:09.711
Adai's face was sad.

00:49:09.771 --> 00:49:15.393
He didn't want me to die, he said quietly.

00:49:15.453 --> 00:49:21.574
He was a good man, and now he's dead.

00:49:21.634 --> 00:49:26.645
And Gog is going to Mars, Saru said.

00:49:26.705 --> 00:49:30.226
Mars, he's crazy.

00:49:30.286 --> 00:49:35.547
Mars isn't ready for people, Adai said.

00:49:35.607 --> 00:49:39.799
But Gog wants to go, and so he's going.

00:49:39.859 --> 00:49:41.792
Saru said.

00:49:41.852 --> 00:49:44.684
Tell us about the moon colony.

00:49:44.744 --> 00:49:46.395
That isn't ready.

00:49:46.455 --> 00:49:48.666
You need more money.

00:49:48.726 --> 00:49:52.440
No, I don't, Adai said.

00:49:52.500 --> 00:49:55.332
The moon colony is ready.

00:49:55.392 --> 00:49:59.396
I asked for more money because of Zadak.

00:49:59.456 --> 00:50:05.049
I wanted to give him money for rain, but Gog didn't listen.

00:50:05.110 --> 00:50:10.457
He wanted all Earth's money for the spaceship to Mars.

00:50:10.517 --> 00:50:16.020
I don't want to leave Earth," Rilla said sadly.

00:50:16.080 --> 00:50:18.324
She felt tired and afraid.

00:50:18.344 --> 00:50:23.364
A dye smiled warmly at Rilla.

00:50:23.424 --> 00:50:27.698
nobody wants to leave earth, he said.

00:50:27.758 --> 00:50:32.179
But under the moon is the best home for us now.

00:50:32.239 --> 00:50:34.260
Wait and see.

00:50:34.320 --> 00:50:49.020
The moon colony is a beautiful, wonderful country with rivers and rain, forests and flowers, buildings and the first town.

00:50:49.080 --> 00:50:56.351
You can visit Earth again soon and bring more people to the moon colony.

00:50:56.412 --> 00:51:01.766
We all want to help Earth because it's our first home.

00:51:01.826 --> 00:51:03.706
I know that.

00:51:03.766 --> 00:51:10.942
At the same time, you are going to be happy under the moon.

00:51:11.002 --> 00:51:14.504
Suddenly, someone cried.

00:51:14.564 --> 00:51:17.844
Look at the moon!

00:51:17.904 --> 00:51:28.988
And through the window of the spaceship, they saw the moon before them, cold, white and beautiful.

00:51:29.048 --> 00:51:34.421
And under the moon, there was the moon colony.

